[00:45.80]You scream, I scream
{"你尖叫 我也尖叫"}
[00:47.42]It was just poor timing
{"只是时机太糟糕"}
[00:49.25]Thought we were through with the lying
{"以为谎言已结束"}
[00:51.54]Don’t know why we keep trying
{"不知为何还坚持"}
[00:53.19]I might’ve lost my focus
{"或许我失了专注"}
[00:55.30]But you kept saying we were hopeless
{"你却总说没希望"}
[00:57.6]Guess we forgot those moments
{"猜我们忘了那些时刻"}
[00:58.92]Thought that I was your chosen
{"曾以为我是你的选择"}
[01:00.84]I know the life has been hard but
{"我知道生活很艰难"}
[01:02.83]Remember when we used to be starstruck
{"记得我们曾为彼此着迷"}
[01:04.65]Butterflies, heart pumped
{"心如鹿撞 怦然心动"}
[01:06.47]Thinking to ourselves, just our luck
{"暗自庆幸 何其幸运"}
[01:08.30]But that’s gone now, sayonara
{"但如今都已消散 再见了"}
[01:10.10]Out of here today and by tomorrow
{"今日离开 明日之前"}
[01:11.96]I’ll open one up and try the bottle
{"我会开瓶酒尝试"}
[01:13.84]Try and mitigate my life of sorrow
{"试图缓解悲伤人生"}
[01:16.41]I know that
{"我知道"}
[01:18.26]It’s hopeless
{"已无望"}
[01:20.5]But take this
{"但收下"}
[01:21.72]A token
{"这信物"}
[01:23.76]I’m broken
{"我破碎"}
[01:25.55]You’re gone now
{"你已离去"}
[01:27.47]I know that
{"我知道"}
[01:29.26]I know that
{"我知道"}
[01:31.19]I know that
{"我知道"}
[01:33.4]I messed up
{"我搞砸了"}
[01:34.78]But what about
{"但那些"}
[01:36.63]The rest of
{"剩下的"}
[01:38.57]The times had
{"时光呢"}
[01:40.45]I’m sorry
{"对不起"}
[01:42.29]You know that
{"你知道的"}
[01:44.12]You know that
{"你知道的"}
[02:14.9]You left me, now, whatcha gonna do?
{"你离开了我　现在　你打算怎么办"}
[02:15.93]Got me in a craze, wondering who you’re gonna screw
{"让我抓狂　猜想着你会和谁缠绵"}
[02:17.97]Not sure about who you keep running to
{"不确定你一直奔向的是谁身边"}
[02:19.94]Calling all my friends, asking them what I should do
{"打给所有朋友　问他们我该怎么办"}
[02:22.0]I remember your face, and it was stunning, too
{"我记得你的脸　也曾让我惊艳"}
[02:23.54]Grab another glass everytime I think I’m coming to
{"每次我以为自己快释怀　就又灌下一杯"}
[02:25.46]You’re life’s not a mess with friends making fun of you
{"你的生活并不混乱　朋友们都在取笑你"}
[02:27.37]Sleep with all these women knowing I am still in love with you
{"和这些女人共枕　却深知我仍爱着你"}
[02:29.61]It’s so hard, and I’m trying to come to terms
{"太难了　我试着接受现实"}
[02:32.26]At the bar, in a slur, find myself a sum of words
{"在酒吧　醉醺醺地　拼凑着只言片语"}
[02:34.39]I’d rather drown in my drinks than my feelings for you
{"我宁愿溺死在酒里　也不愿沉沦于对你的感情"}
[02:40.4]I’ll forget that night, and hopefully you too
{"我会忘记那晚　但愿也能忘记你"}
[02:43.45]Come on!
[02:44.60]I know that
{"我知道"}
[02:46.50]It’s hopeless
{"没希望了"}
